{"id":"1f704fe342a953fa","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-comp-universal-machine.md","title":"ZFC Comp Universal Machine","display":"df-zfc-comp-universal-machine — ZFC Comp Universal Machine","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comp-universal-machine","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comp-universal-machine"],"display":"df-zfc-comp-universal-machine — ZFC Comp Universal Machine","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-comp-partial-recursive-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comp-universal-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comp-universal-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comp-universal-machine — ZFC Comp Universal Machine"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fd4c422bf948097\" href=\"?note=5fd4c422bf948097\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-comp-partial-recursive-function.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-comp-partial-recursive-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,\\varphi\\in V\">\\(U,\\varphi\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fd4c422bf948097\" href=\"?note=5fd4c422bf948097\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-comp-partial-recursive-function.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-comp-partial-recursive-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathcal P:V\\to V\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCompUniversalMachine}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCompUniversalMachine}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}universal\\text{-}machine} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompUniversalMachine}_S(U,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S(U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\varphi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S(\\varphi(e))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S(f)\n\\to\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;(f=\\varphi(e))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall e,x,y\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\langle e,x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in U\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi(e)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}universal\\text{-}machine} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompUniversalMachine}_S(U,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S(U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\varphi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S(\\varphi(e))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S(f)\n\\to\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;(f=\\varphi(e))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall e,x,y\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\langle e,x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in U\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi(e)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>通用机必须相对于一个枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 定义；断言同时要求枚举覆盖全部一元部分递归函数，并用配对输入给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 的计算图。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-comp-partial-recursive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fd4c422bf948097","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-comp-partial-recursive-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-comp-partial-recursive-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fd4c422bf948097","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V$（see [[../batch09/58-df-zfc-comp-partial-recursive-function.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$（see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P:V\\to V$（see [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"U,\\varphi\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCompUniversalMachine}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comp\\text{-}universal\\text{-}machine} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompUniversalMachine}_S(U,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S(U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\varphi,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\omega\\times\\omega))\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl(\\forall e\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S(\\varphi(e))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcCompPartialRecursiveFunction}_S(f)\n\\to\\exists e\\in\\omega\\;(f=\\varphi(e))\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall e,x,y\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\langle\\langle e,x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in U\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in\\varphi(e)\n\\Bigr)\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false}],"bytes":1621,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1765","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-comp-universal-machine.md|58-df-zfc-comp-universal-machine]]（batch1